{"id":"665299","name":"混合面馒头","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/665299/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"350g"},{"name":"细玉米粉","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"20g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"4.5g"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"玉米面粉中加入适量开水烫一下。","img":"images/665299/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋2个","img":"images/665299/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"晾凉后加入白糖。","img":"images/665299/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入鸡蛋。","img":"images/665299/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入面粉。","img":"images/665299/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"猪油用10g。","img":"images/665299/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"酵母中加入适量的水。","img":"images/665299/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入酵母水及猪油搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665299/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"和匀面团发酵。","img":"images/665299/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"发好的面团。","img":"images/665299/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分成均等的剂子揉成馒头胚进行二次发酵。","img":"images/665299/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"次饧发完成。","img":"images/665299/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"水开后蒸15至20分钟，停火后3至5分钟后再打开盖子。","img":"images/665299/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"馒头喧软膨松。","img":"images/665299/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装入盘中，粗细粮搭配，混合面馒头偶尔吃一次很好吃。","img":"images/665299/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}